OL,3,GNEWSATories committed to pension triple
OL,4,Alock, deputy leader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative deputy leader Alex
OL,7,FBurghart has described pensioners as a
OL,8,F"special case" as he reaffirmed the
OL,9,Fparty's commitment to the state pension
OL,10,Ftriple lock.
OL,12,FHe argued that retirees deserve
OL,13,Fdifferent treatment because, once they
OL,14,Fstop working, they can do "absolutely
OL,15,Fnothing" to increase their income.
OL,17,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has set out
OL,18,Fplans to end the existing state pension
OL,19,Ftriple lock from 2030 to help fund a
OL,20,Fnew national care service.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
